{"seq":1,"slug":"five-level-routing-lookup","title":"OpenClaw 路由 5 级 lookup 详解","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/five-level-routing-lookup","wordCount":1413,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"openclaw-路由-5-级-lookup-详解\">OpenClaw 路由 5 级 lookup 详解</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OpenClaw 的核心差异化能力是<strong>同一物理用户可绑定多个 persona，每个 persona 看到自己的隔离世界</strong>。把一条 inbound 消息映射到正确 persona 的过程被实现为 5 级有序 lookup：<strong>peer → parent → guild/roles → account → channel → fallback</strong>。lookup 按这个顺序逐级匹配，&quot;earlier wins&quot;——越具体的规则优先级越高。这种设计的好处是 admin 只需要给少数特殊情况写显式规则，大部分流量由更粗粒度的 channel / account fallback 兜底。本篇按&quot;为什么是 5 级、每级语义、命中优先级、规则 DSL&quot;四块讲清，DM pairing 与 isolation 细节走 <a href=\"dm-pairing-and-isolation\"><code>./2_dm-pairing-and-isolation.md</code></a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IN[Inbound msg] --&gt; L1[1. peer match?]&#10;  L1 -- yes --&gt; H[Hit persona]&#10;  L1 -- no --&gt; L2[2. parent match?]&#10;  L2 -- yes --&gt; H&#10;  L2 -- no --&gt; L3[3. guild/roles match?]&#10;  L3 -- yes --&gt; H&#10;  L3 -- no --&gt; L4[4. account match?]&#10;  L4 -- yes --&gt; H&#10;  L4 -- no --&gt; L5[5. channel match?]&#10;  L5 -- yes --&gt; H&#10;  L5 -- no --&gt; FB[6. fallback persona]\">flowchart TD\n  IN[Inbound msg] --&gt; L1[1. peer match?]\n  L1 -- yes --&gt; H[Hit persona]\n  L1 -- no --&gt; L2[2. parent match?]\n  L2 -- yes --&gt; H\n  L2 -- no --&gt; L3[3. guild/roles match?]\n  L3 -- yes --&gt; H\n  L3 -- no --&gt; L4[4. account match?]\n  L4 -- yes --&gt; H\n  L4 -- no --&gt; L5[5. channel match?]\n  L5 -- yes --&gt; H\n  L5 -- no --&gt; FB[6. fallback persona]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>典型规则数</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>peer</td>\n<td>单一对端用户</td>\n<td>5-20 条</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>parent</td>\n<td>父群继承</td>\n<td>10-50 条</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>guild/roles</td>\n<td>角色组</td>\n<td>5-15 条</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>account</td>\n<td>整个平台账号</td>\n<td>1-3 条</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>channel</td>\n<td>频道默认</td>\n<td>50-200 条</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>fallback</td>\n<td>全局兜底</td>\n<td>1 条</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第-1-级-peer-点对点路由\">第 1 级：peer 点对点路由</h2><p>peer rule 写&quot;和某个具体用户 1:1 沟通时用某 persona&quot;。它最具体，所以优先级最高。例子：用户在飞书私聊里 1:1 跟同事 Alice 沟通时永远用 <code>dev_bytedance</code> persona，跟开源社区贡献者 Bob 沟通时永远用 <code>dev_oss</code> persona——不管这两个 DM channel 在哪个 channel id 下。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"peer_rules:&#10;  - peer_id: &#39;ou_alice_xxx&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;同事工作沟通&#39;&#10;  - peer_id: &#39;uxxx_bob_oss&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_oss&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;开源贡献者&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ou_alice_xxx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'同事工作沟通'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uxxx_bob_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'开源贡献者'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>peer 规则数量通常少（5-20），因为人不会和无限多人有&quot;绝对 persona 绑定&quot;。这一级的命中场景集中在&quot;长期工作关系 + 工作私聊&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第-2-级-parent-父群继承\">第 2 级：parent 父群继承</h2><p>OpenClaw 把群组关系建模为可嵌套的 parent-child tree。父群有规则时，子群自动继承——除非子群有自己的更具体规则。这一级解决&quot;团队 workspace 下有多个项目 channel，希望统一 persona 但不想每 channel 写一遍&quot;的痛点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  W[Workspace: bytedance-team] --&gt; C1[Channel: frontend-dev]&#10;  W --&gt; C2[Channel: rpc-design]&#10;  W --&gt; C3[Channel: incident-room]&#10;  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C1&#10;  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C2&#10;  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C3\">flowchart TD\n  W[Workspace: bytedance-team] --&gt; C1[Channel: frontend-dev]\n  W --&gt; C2[Channel: rpc-design]\n  W --&gt; C3[Channel: incident-room]\n  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C1\n  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C2\n  W -. inherits dev_bytedance .-&gt; C3</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"parent_rules:&#10;  - parent_id: &#39;workspace_bytedance&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    inherit_to_children: true&#10;  - parent_id: &#39;workspace_oss_lynx&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_oss&#39;&#10;    inherit_to_children: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">parent_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'workspace_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inherit_to_children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'workspace_oss_lynx'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inherit_to_children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>子 channel 上若有显式 channel rule 会覆盖 parent rule——只是父子级别上 parent 在 lookup 优先级里靠前，是因为它通常是 admin 显式声明的&quot;团队级&quot;决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第-3-级-guild-roles-角色组\">第 3 级：guild/roles 角色组</h2><p>guild 与 roles 是平台原生概念（Discord 称 role，Slack 称 user group，飞书称群角色）。规则按角色匹配——只要消息发送者在某角色组里就触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"role_rules:&#10;  - role_id: &#39;moderator&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;ops_admin&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;moderator 行为需要 ops 上下文&#39;&#10;  - role_id: &#39;external_contractor&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_external_safe&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;外部合作者用受限 persona&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'moderator'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ops_admin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'moderator 行为需要 ops 上下文'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">role_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'external_contractor'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_external_safe'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'外部合作者用受限 persona'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一级适合&quot;按角色而非具体人&quot;的策略。例如把&quot;所有 moderator 的请求&quot;路由到 <code>ops_admin</code> persona——admin 不必维护谁是 moderator 名单，平台自身的角色变更会自动反映到路由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第-4-级-account-账号级-fallback\">第 4 级：account 账号级 fallback</h2><p>account 规则按&quot;消息所在平台账号&quot;匹配。这是个比较粗的兜底层，通常一个 platform 一条规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"account_rules:&#10;  - account_id: &#39;lark_account_self&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;personal_default&#39;&#10;  - account_id: &#39;slack_workspace_oss&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_oss&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">account_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_account_self'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack_workspace_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_oss'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它的作用是&quot;如果这个平台账号本身就属于某 persona（如 OSS 专用 Slack workspace），所有未被前 3 级匹配的消息都默认归到该 persona&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第-5-级-channel-频道默认\">第 5 级：channel 频道默认</h2><p>channel rule 是数量最多的一级（50-200）。它写&quot;某个具体 channel 默认归哪个 persona&quot;。这一级排在 account 之后是有意为之——同一 account 下的不同 channel 通常归同一 persona，account 规则可以一次性兜底，channel rule 只写少数异常 channel：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"channel_rules:&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;lark_oc_abc&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;hobby_writing&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;写作社群&#39;&#10;  - channel_id: &#39;slack_C12345&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_oss&#39;&#10;    reason: &#39;Lynx framework channel&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_oc_abc'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hobby_writing'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'写作社群'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'slack_C12345'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_oss'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Lynx framework channel'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"第-6-级-fallback-全局兜底\">第 6 级：fallback 全局兜底</h2><p>最后一级是单一 fallback persona。没有任何级别命中时，消息归到这里。fallback 通常是 <code>personal_default</code>——最受限制、最少权限的 persona：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"fallback:&#10;  persona: &#39;personal_default&#39;&#10;  warn_on_use: true&#10;  audit_event_type: &#39;fallback_routing&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'personal_default'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  warn_on_use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  audit_event_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fallback_routing'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>warn_on_use: true</code> 表示每次 fallback 命中都 emit 一条 audit_event，提醒 admin 检查&quot;是不是有漏写规则&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命中优先级与冲突\">命中优先级与冲突</h2><p>规则 lookup 严格按 1-6 顺序，<strong>earlier wins</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[peer rule: dev_bytedance] --&gt; X[Hit: dev_bytedance]&#10;  B[parent rule: dev_oss] -. ignored .-&gt; X&#10;  C[channel rule: hobby] -. ignored .-&gt; X\">flowchart LR\n  A[peer rule: dev_bytedance] --&gt; X[Hit: dev_bytedance]\n  B[parent rule: dev_oss] -. ignored .-&gt; X\n  C[channel rule: hobby] -. ignored .-&gt; X</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突类型</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同一级别多条匹配</td>\n<td>按 rule 内 <code>priority</code> 字段决定（默认按声明顺序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨级别多条匹配</td>\n<td>level 数字小者优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全冲突（应平局）</td>\n<td>OpenClaw 启动时静态检测，admin 必须显式排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>启动时的冲突检测是关键保护——避免运行时不可预测的路由行为。规则文件改动后 OpenClaw 会 dry-run 一遍所有规则组合，检测到歧义就拒绝 reload。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺省行为与-routing-rule-dsl\">缺省行为与 routing rule DSL</h2><p>规则用一种小型 DSL 表达：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"peer_rules:&#10;  - match:&#10;      peer_id: &#39;ou_alice_*&#39;&#10;      platform: &#39;lark&#39;&#10;    persona: &#39;dev_bytedance&#39;&#10;    priority: 10&#10;    audit: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">peer_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      peer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ou_alice_*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dev_bytedance'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DSL 字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>match</td>\n<td>匹配条件，支持 glob / regex</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona</td>\n<td>命中后的 persona</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>priority</td>\n<td>同级多条时的次序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>audit</td>\n<td>是否 emit audit_event</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>valid_until</td>\n<td>规则有效期，过期自动失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>valid_until 让&quot;临时 persona 绑定&quot;成为可能：例如&quot;这周与外部审计 Bob 的所有消息走 audit_persona，下周自动恢复&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>以为 lookup 是&quot;先到先得&quot;</strong>：实际是&quot;按 5 级严格排序&quot;。即便 channel rule 先写，peer rule 后写，命中时 peer 仍优先。</li>\n<li><strong>parent rule 没声明 inherit_to_children</strong>：默认 <code>false</code>，admin 经常误以为有继承。明确写 true。</li>\n<li><strong>role_id 在不同平台 ID 重名</strong>：飞书 vs Slack 的 moderator role id 完全不同。规则的 role_id 应带 platform 前缀。</li>\n<li><strong>fallback 用 admin persona</strong>：极度危险——任何漏写规则都让消息以 admin 权限处理。fallback 必须是最受限 persona。</li>\n<li><strong>valid_until 过期前未告警</strong>：rule 静默过期，admin 不知。OpenClaw 提供&quot;过期前 24h 告警&quot;配置。</li>\n<li><strong>同级 priority 全为 default</strong>：多条 peer rule 都按声明顺序，但 rule 文件被 git merge 后顺序可能变。重要规则必须显式 priority。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>OpenClaw 的 5 级 lookup（peer → parent → guild/roles → account → channel → fallback）是 multi-tenant 工具栈的核心路由协议。&quot;earlier wins&quot;让 admin 只需写少量具体规则覆盖特例，粗粒度规则兜底大部分流量。规则文件改动后的启动期冲突检测、valid_until 临时绑定、audit_event emit on fallback——这三处工程细节让 5 级 lookup 在实际部署里既灵活又可审计。下一篇讲 DM pairing 模型与 persona 之间的隔离边界，看路由命中后 persona 如何真正生效。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenClaw 路由 5 级 lookup 详解","id":"openclaw-路由-5-级-lookup-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第 1 级：peer 点对点路由","id":"第-1-级-peer-点对点路由"},{"level":2,"text":"第 2 级：parent 父群继承","id":"第-2-级-parent-父群继承"},{"level":2,"text":"第 3 级：guild/roles 角色组","id":"第-3-级-guild-roles-角色组"},{"level":2,"text":"第 4 级：account 账号级 fallback","id":"第-4-级-account-账号级-fallback"},{"level":2,"text":"第 5 级：channel 频道默认","id":"第-5-级-channel-频道默认"},{"level":2,"text":"第 6 级：fallback 全局兜底","id":"第-6-级-fallback-全局兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"命中优先级与冲突","id":"命中优先级与冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"缺省行为与 routing rule DSL","id":"缺省行为与-routing-rule-dsl"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"与 Tier 1 Hooks 协同的跨 tier 桥接模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/hooks-with-tier-1-bridge"},"next":{"title":"DM pairing 与 persona 隔离工作空间","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/multi-tenant-personas/dm-pairing-and-isolation"}}